{
  "map": "UndeadRE02_03",
  "title": "Blackrock Encampment",
  "locale": "zhCN",
  "order_note": "Sorted by recording id: C (cinematics), M (in-engine cutscenes), T (gameplay transmissions); unit barks follow their trigger group. Interleaving of C/M/T is not confirmed.",
  "lines": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "id": "A2M3-T010-ANYA",
      "scene": "Dialogues.Transmissions Dialogue 01 Orcs Stain On These Lands",
      "speaker": "恩雅",
      "text": "兽人。多年以来，他们一直是这片土地上的污点。",
      "string_id": 39,
      "speaker_string_id": 40,
      "sound": "Sound/Dialogue/UndeadRECamp/Undeadre02m3/A2M3-T010-ANYA.ogg"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "id": "A2M3-T020-LEONID",
      "scene": "Dialogues.Transmissions Dialogue 01 Orcs Stain On These Lands",
      "speaker": "莱尼德",
      "text": "并非所有兽人都是这样。不过黑石氏族的劫掠者是以残暴闻名的。",
      "string_id": 319,
      "speaker_string_id": 320,
      "sound": "Sound/Dialogue/UndeadRECamp/Undeadre02m3/A2M3-T020-LEONID.ogg"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "id": "A2M3-T030-GAREK",
      "scene": "Dialogues.Transmissions Dialogue 01 Orcs Stain On These Lands",
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "那我们就去“劝劝”他们别再劫掠被遗忘者了。",
      "string_id": 317,
      "speaker_string_id": 318,
      "sound": "Sound/Dialogue/UndeadRECamp/Undeadre02m3/A2M3-T030-GAREK.ogg"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "id": "A2M3-T040-ANYA",
      "scene": "Dialogues.Transmissions Dialogue 02 The Deed Is Done",
      "speaker": "恩雅",
      "text": "任务完成了。希望其他兽人能够听从这次警告。",
      "string_id": 53,
      "speaker_string_id": 54,
      "sound": "Sound/Dialogue/UndeadRECamp/Undeadre02m3/A2M3-T040-ANYA.ogg"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "id": "A2M3-T050-GAREK",
      "scene": "Dialogues.Transmissions Dialogue 03 Not All Orcs",
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "莱尼德，你说并非所有兽人都会对这片土地造成威胁。你遇见过其他兽人吗？",
      "string_id": 57,
      "speaker_string_id": 58,
      "sound": "Sound/Dialogue/UndeadRECamp/Undeadre02m3/A2M3-T050-GAREK.ogg"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "id": "A2M3-T060-LEONID",
      "scene": "Dialogues.Transmissions Dialogue 03 Not All Orcs",
      "speaker": "莱尼德",
      "text": "是啊，在银色黎明时。我听说一名年轻的大酋长率领许多兽人渡海离开了。",
      "string_id": 335,
      "speaker_string_id": 336,
      "sound": "Sound/Dialogue/UndeadRECamp/Undeadre02m3/A2M3-T060-LEONID.ogg"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "id": "A2M3-T061-LEONID",
      "scene": "Dialogues.Transmissions Dialogue 03 Not All Orcs",
      "speaker": "莱尼德",
      "text": "据说他正在打造一个重视力量和荣誉的“新部落”。",
      "string_id": 325,
      "speaker_string_id": 326,
      "sound": "Sound/Dialogue/UndeadRECamp/Undeadre02m3/A2M3-T061-LEONID.ogg"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "id": "A2M3-T070-ANYA",
      "scene": "Dialogues.Transmissions Dialogue 03 Not All Orcs",
      "speaker": "恩雅",
      "text": "除非亲眼看见，否则我绝不相信。",
      "string_id": 71,
      "speaker_string_id": 72,
      "sound": "Sound/Dialogue/UndeadRECamp/Undeadre02m3/A2M3-T070-ANYA.ogg"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "id": "HeroBladeMasterYesAttack3",
      "scene": "Dialogues.Transmissions Dialogue 04 Blademaster Taunt 1",
      "speaker": "尼科洛",
      "text": "尝尝我的利刃！",
      "string_id": 341,
      "speaker_string_id": 342,
      "sound": "Units/Orc/HeroBladeMaster/HeroBladeMasterYesAttack3.flac"
